{"asset_key":"timeline/env_story_11202470","episode":"timeline","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120246001:":{"text":"……俺の負けだ。","source_cn":"……是我输了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3479F6127078C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120246002:":{"text":"クージン、想像以上に手強い相手だったぞ。","source_cn":"库金，你比我想象中的还要强大","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FCC253EE9C3405D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120246003:":{"text":"お前の攻撃には何度も驚かされた。","source_cn":"好几次，你的攻击都让我感到心惊","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8073A71E4049BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120246004:":{"text":"だけど俺は負けたんだ。この結果を受け入れるよ。","source_cn":"但我还是输了，我接受这个结果","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4589712C20F7D224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120247001:1":{"text":"クルーガー……叔父さん。あなたならブラックロアー族を頂点まで導いてくれると信じてる。","source_cn":"克鲁格，我的叔叔，我相信你是那个能带领黑嚎氏族走上巅峰的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3E4AA835B8F41BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120247002:1":{"text":"父上がこのことを知ったら……きっと安心して氏族をあなたに任せるはずだ。","source_cn":"父亲如果知道了这件事……一定也会放心把黑嚎氏族交给你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5080EB2CDA46BBCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120247003:1":{"text":"お前は優秀な戦士だ。オルグもお前を誇りに思うことだろう。","source_cn":"你已经成长为出色的战士了，奥格会为你感到骄傲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FF4CE3D186F1DBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120247004:1":{"text":"……ありがとう、クルーガー。","source_cn":"……谢谢您，克鲁格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674501E015953602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120247005:1":{"text":"成長したな、クージン。","source_cn":"你进步了，库金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE8BA349C1A9FC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120247006:0":{"text":"でもお前には及ばない、そうだろう？","source_cn":"但还比不上你，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04CF6FB19EB79AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120247007:1":{"text":"あぁ、まだまだだな！","source_cn":"嗯，还缺点火候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E273FB309C163C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120247008:1":{"text":"……ソーン！こんな時にそんなこと言っちゃダメだよ！","source_cn":"……索恩！这种时候还是别这么说啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB720E884FC7B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120247009:2":{"text":"いいんだ。次に会う時は、お前と勝負してやる。","source_cn":"没关系。等下次见面，我会再和你决斗一场的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E3F280EB8F653A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120247010:1":{"text":"あぁ、待ってる。","source_cn":"那我就等着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x314E43F1602855A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120247011:1":{"text":"お前たち……","source_cn":"你们两个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123803121C418040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1120247011":{"text":"お前たち……","source_cn":"你们两个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123803121C418040","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120247012:1":{"text":"はは、俺もそう思う。","source_cn":"哈哈，我也这么觉得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1805A424BA84C824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120247013:1":{"text":"そうだ、あとで氏族の祝典を開くんだ。馳走もあるし、ぜひ参加してくれ。","source_cn":"对了，稍后族内会举行一场庆祝，有一顿大餐，欢迎赏脸参与。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E97BDB94C018C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120247014:0":{"text":"わぁ、ご馳走まであるなんて！","source_cn":"哇，竟然还有大餐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A55ABA5FFCD381E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120247015:0":{"text":"新たな族長の誕生を祝って、氏族の奴らが用意したんだ。","source_cn":"为了庆祝新族长的诞生，族人准备了美味的食物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08875D1779F0A67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120247016:0":{"text":"それなら、絶対に参加するよ！ねっ？","source_cn":"既然如此，那我们一定要去了！对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F286B48727631FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120247017:0":{"text":"……オレも行くよ。","source_cn":"……我可以陪你们去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0162169CFCEB180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"",